            <div xml:id="m-7cdb063f-124a-45ff-8147-9ebfab5177b6">
              <lg xml:id="m-03ec2178-43e8-43e6-ab2f-a293cf773787">
                <l xml:id="m-b23bbd45-1e25-4942-b6bd-f5d751fcc5e5" facs="#m-96d2d9a4-5d79-4a7f-abf7-9d3f5f57a05a" label="ambiguous">Ember Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-fa93f18c-7560-4e02-be18-46ceae012e1d" facs="#m-2edf6e04-c1ae-49d9-ad2f-2eef8204775e" label="ambiguous">902</l><l xml:id="m-c4d8b435-1b02-4dc5-967c-32e7b7e46912" facs="#m-742c129f-0ed0-4d7a-a56c-4f5512081259" label="lyrics-like">est * quídquam.</l><l xml:id="m-9e142da5-654b-423f-9a09-0f11d1a01926" facs="#m-b5766cbe-19ec-4ab5-901e-5a2a1bbdb4ca" label="lyrics-like">au- tem non pród¬</l><l xml:id="m-211b5a27-24c4-4dae-844b-44229efbe94f" facs="#m-b216ad9c-6cdf-4cb4-baeb-bf04950362d9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7a5089c2-6f37-4afe-81fb-5cf8779e34b8" facs="#m-f9802335-f227-483a-a5cc-673053bbf4cb" label="lyrics-like">TLlo nos igne, quaésumus Dómi-l ménter accéndi: Qui tecum vivit</l><l xml:id="m-c9a57830-80a9-4a0d-9330-f9d1a46aeb39" facs="#m-169dce93-389b-43d4-be67-81d983a7eae3" label="lyrics-like">L ne, Spiritus Sanctus inflámmet:</l><l xml:id="m-e8aa3b97-827f-44a2-af7b-b797ea852b3f" facs="#m-8b5a24f4-5863-48de-b1c7-2f6dbe325581" label="lyrics-like">et regnat in unitáte ejúsdem Spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-28a5f723-8dbd-4423-ab19-40629da490cd" facs="#m-b9bc7605-e424-4728-8824-e9adf2ab3c90" label="ambiguous">tus Sancti Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-3ac8a5f1-efd5-49b2-9200-849742f04edf" facs="#m-f9211900-9c6a-4049-952b-1e3124e08155" label="lyrics-like">quem Dóminus noster Jesus Christus</l><l xml:id="m-3d1113cd-f09b-4135-b48f-c8a2205ef006" facs="#m-a9eeb2a3-4642-4b96-b537-47c16094b68d" label="lyrics-like">misit in terram,* et vóluit vehe¬</l><l xml:id="m-0bd59d02-0e7a-43e8-9b0b-c7a40e26018e" facs="#m-8b2b55ea-b879-4b2c-b210-27a1aad5228a" label="ambiguous">Lesson II.</l><l xml:id="m-c2d8ed98-bae0-4319-940b-835e5b79934f" facs="#m-ca5012e3-882b-43c2-9fbb-4dac80445222" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Levitici. Levit. 23. b.</l><l xml:id="m-04d178ec-a4c8-4253-aeef-2909831db858" facs="#m-c66a38bc-6565-4885-a68b-8942e744babc" label="lyrics-like">(N diébus illis: Locútus est Dómi¬ diem expletiónis hebdómadae sépti¬</l><l xml:id="m-dda2c295-5e4d-4ebc-bc3b-d15e96b28d5e" facs="#m-7265cce6-5136-4ff8-87d4-44a5f022902c" label="lyrics-like">L nus ad Móysen, dicens: Lóquere</l><l xml:id="m-905b0d51-7ba9-4096-92b7-fd65c9366611" facs="#m-fa4f055b-9c89-49d5-9e1a-d2a0ca9f1a45" label="ambiguous">mae, id est, quinquaginta dies: et</l><l xml:id="m-14997e6c-acec-432d-9a4e-2994f554a8d1" facs="#m-b5d17701-1853-46de-ae54-9fc44203bf13" label="ambiguous">filiis Israel, et dices ad eos: Cum</l><l xml:id="m-63b0b00b-308d-4a9a-89d0-faa718e179d2" facs="#m-69812ed5-1eef-45c2-bc7f-b5b1b4933fc2" label="lyrics-like">sic offerétis sacrificium novum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-16be4cbc-f8cc-4a8e-91d0-66cf40d580e9" facs="#m-fd24fbd9-429c-4152-9dbf-6357f6598a7b" label="lyrics-like">ingréssi fuéritis terram, quam ego</l><l xml:id="m-b607cd88-cc23-4a54-ba8d-a4efb026eb70" facs="#m-624424e8-1d78-40ec-b413-f4b99f14811f" label="lyrics-like">mino ex ómnibus habitáculis vestris,</l><l xml:id="m-e2179c61-0be9-461a-a981-64b0a72c96c1" facs="#m-27442c74-24d8-45c6-a27e-c3cb37de265f" label="lyrics-like">dabo vobis, et messuéritis ségetem,</l><l xml:id="m-23ce0c7c-14e4-42c0-ba96-c2b27a45be46" facs="#m-d1809b8f-326f-4dae-ac38-456a89fbfaf7" label="lyrics-like">panes primitiárum duos de duábus</l><l xml:id="m-5b5b519d-9953-46b2-b32f-8af9b74862e3" facs="#m-c257a349-90e8-4689-a0c2-483c28a4834a" label="lyrics-like">ferétis manipulos spicárum, primi¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fc90ac7-bc56-4544-8b58-ca8713c3c5e6" facs="#m-c1bfc2ee-207d-4aa9-8752-ba54d22dd8bc" label="lyrics-like">décimis símilae fermentátae, quos</l><l xml:id="m-5366ed1e-c227-465e-8d31-ffe0ae2270da" facs="#m-ad5db946-5c06-4992-b5f9-fa1678ce67c6" label="lyrics-like">coquétis in primitias Dómini. Et</l><l xml:id="m-7c538478-c894-44d7-ba2a-682b0cd243f2" facs="#m-c952bdcf-2c44-462b-b07c-3edea3acd71b" label="lyrics-like">tias messis vestrae ad sacerdótem:</l><l xml:id="m-0f06d1a5-700c-467f-ac1e-3b70132cc6c7" facs="#m-6bb5faef-7513-4a03-a258-8af88e3d1612" label="lyrics-like">qui elevábit fascículum coram Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ac8edb4-967e-42d5-86a5-4f49b59446d2" facs="#m-9db5dd14-c8c4-45db-b7d0-a223b4e11bf2" label="lyrics-like">vocábitis hunc diem celebérrimum,</l><l xml:id="m-f53a8d3a-0a86-4918-a15b-ea1366b57709" facs="#m-8fb5cb9c-005b-49c4-987d-d1def95d65e4" label="lyrics-like">mino, ut acceptábile sit pro vobis,</l><l xml:id="m-ba298e7e-1b1d-4bd3-88a0-5dbbbeb2b1e3" facs="#m-82292050-0b07-4cab-bd44-b19f8eb6958e" label="lyrics-like">atque sanctíssimum: omne opus</l><l xml:id="m-58fbcb18-0295-4a6e-808e-d087ebe5adf5" facs="#m-1512f552-0228-4458-b1e9-cdc76443da56" label="lyrics-like">áltero die sábbati, et sanctificábit</l><l xml:id="m-42836608-ca06-44c2-8dbc-c4bdf70c70d6" facs="#m-806d56f5-150b-4a02-aef9-f94580fc367f" label="lyrics-like">servile non faciétis in eo. Legitimum</l><l xml:id="m-a5e1258b-b9be-40ac-9b86-84e965c9ec55" facs="#m-8bc3b22e-c4b4-4f26-b208-01b7ab6f2c53" label="lyrics-like">illum. Numerábitis ergo ab áltero</l><l xml:id="m-4b938c17-4112-4c81-a5c8-137b004d5f56" facs="#m-e841e2bd-2d9f-45a1-a912-896b55646661" label="lyrics-like">sempitérnum erit in cunctis habitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7aa9ca77-48e7-4365-be98-0afd3c60c6a0" facs="#m-784b054e-eeec-4f83-84de-be04543b2e4b" label="lyrics-like">die sábbati, in quo obtulístis mani¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f84a402-178a-410e-83c0-bbed75dcaed6" facs="#m-7ca67897-1873-4ead-8b4e-c1aadb5022b8" label="lyrics-like">culis, et generatiónibus vestris</l><l xml:id="m-37120930-7cc0-49e8-9904-b6d5cd0e015e" facs="#m-b32a59e2-70aa-4986-a141-dd6c9e29e2f6" label="lyrics-like">pulum primitiárum, septem hebdó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ccfe77d6-8916-492e-a045-64342f6ac29e" facs="#m-b72c9440-fb6b-438a-8c21-5dd4c896a901" label="lyrics-like">dicit Dóminus omnípotens.</l><l xml:id="m-11207776-bcd4-4b32-94af-cf45bd3d5616" facs="#m-5d96b75d-a7f5-457a-9510-6029fabb8c90" label="lyrics-like">madas plenas, usque ad álteram</l><l xml:id="m-6154cc2e-03e9-4f08-84d4-5c373b169a30" facs="#m-f800d0c7-3ae9-4c2c-abc0-7658a0eded28" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-3565fb97-3e7c-460c-873f-f5392b5b2d14" facs="#m-e218d654-6583-491b-b2ef-f0514d8e611f" label="ambiguous">H "e</l><l xml:id="m-d1bbadc0-be03-4142-bb2a-1883fc2baeb0" facs="#m-db68724b-8f24-474b-bb77-70d1995257a2" label="lyrics-like">V. Spí-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-44bc4001-ebcd-4c72-98c7-71b62a322594" facs="#m-eb560f81-aeae-4771-ae3e-53e89dc28856" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-b85fc91d-b043-43df-8f4a-e44cf90d743e" facs="#m-e76b2b41-eef9-4a0c-874b-83831a8b197c" label="lyrics-like">vit * caé-los.</l><l xml:id="m-3aca4ff1-5907-430d-b3ba-ed69939b97fa" facs="#m-62dd0748-278f-4fb1-9cd7-8da57902cd32" label="lyrics-like">orná¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4c113be-475a-4130-a88e-600233b1886a" facs="#m-d4c9cff0-2d9f-450b-99bf-8632af02ab90" label="lyrics-like">tus é¬ jus</l><l xml:id="m-9607dcfb-76b9-424b-8bf7-5fe1403ce55e" facs="#m-f55fc78f-7f7b-415c-b891-23a2a891f61b" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0432889a-b658-425d-8cb9-24bd6e20930b" facs="#m-6236dcba-3627-4c74-8193-e628e1b98f27" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ad animárum medé- bis propitius;“et mente, et córpore</l><l xml:id="m-b21f374e-75d3-47f4-8a8e-b4032ae4f834" facs="#m-5a44dbc6-230f-4935-b9e6-e1f4958fd84c" label="lyrics-like">I lam, jejúnii devotióne castigári l tibi semper esse devótos. Per Dômi¬</l><l xml:id="m-17faee20-99c3-442d-871b-d59f9a985184" facs="#m-220dbf0c-2130-48eb-8b30-8c5942a30425" label="lyrics-like">córpora praecepísti: t concéde no-l num.</l></lg>
